---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="about" class="reveal">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow-num">02 / about</p>
            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>
                I'm <strong>{site.name}</strong>, a driven and technically versatile Systems Development graduate currently working as a Junior Systems Developer at Future ProTechY. I hold a Diploma (HDIPSD2) from Boston City Campus with a 76% Pass with Distinction average.
            </p>
            <p>
                I work across the full development stack — <strong>Java, PHP, JavaScript, React, Node.js, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, MySQL, Android, and Astro</strong> — with additional expertise in cybersecurity, networking, business analysis, and software testing. I'm passionate about building secure, scalable systems that stay correct under load.
            </p>
            <p>
                Beyond technical skills, I bring strong foundations in business analysis, requirements gathering, and process management. I'm constantly learning and exploring emerging technologies, particularly in AI workflow implementation and cybersecurity practices.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts">
            <li><span class="k">based</span><span class="v">{site.city}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">focus</span><span class="v">{site.focusLabel}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">currently</span><span class="v">{site.currently}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">stack</span><span class="v">{site.stack}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">education</span><span class="v">Diploma HDIPSD2 (76% Distinction)</span></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
